request.description:
Chat with documents using RAG. Searches indexed content, builds context, and generates an AI response. Supports streaming (SSE) and non-streaming modes. When stream=true, response is SSE with events: model-fallback, sources, and data chunks.

Non-streaming response shape:
{
  "answer": "string",
  "model": "string",
  "usage": { ... },
  "sources": [{ "content": "...", "score": 0.9, "attributes": { ... } }],
  "modelFallback": { "requested": "...", "actual": "..." }
}

Rate limit: 20 requests per window.

General chat with the Budds study companion. No document context; uses LLM knowledge only.

Response:
{
  "answer": "string",
  "model": "string",
  "usage": { ... },
  "modelFallback": { "requested": "...", "actual": "..." }
}

Extracts 6-10 key topics from folder documents for quiz generation.

Response:
{
  "topics": ["Machine Learning Basics", "Neural Network Architecture", ...]
}

